  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It came recently to my attention that passwords have been one the of the biggest targets for hackers. I suggest that if someone didn't played for over a month, the game would prompt them to change their password and only then they can connect to the game. This would help improve security especially if you haven't played the game in a while because who knows what happened during the last month on your account? Maybe you got hacked? We don't know. Anyway, this would help (but not make them immune) to keep a higher level of standard for accounts safety. Not only is changing your password safe but also I would suggest making the minimum password length to 12 characters with one capital letter and at least 2 numbers. This would help greatly.",
